{"seq":38,"at":"2026-10-23","kind":"corrected","target":{"type":"article","id":"a0773"},"reason":"Duden and DWDS label the sports sense of Stafette (relay team / relay race) as old-fashioned; the body no longer claims it is today's word (everyday German says Staffel) and a note explains the card's 'today'.","by":"provenance-research","sources":[{"url":"https://www.duden.de/rechtschreibung/Stafette"},{"url":"https://www.dwds.de/wb/Stafette"}],"changes":[{"field":"bodyEn","diff":[["=",198],["-","today"],["+","in"],["=",1],["+","sport "],["=",4],["-","is"],["+","came"],["=",1],["+","to mean "],["=",32],["-","is"],["+","a"],["=",1],["+","Stafettenlauf – "],["=",2],["-","Stafettenlauf."],["+","usage"],["=",1],["+","dictionaries now mark as old-fashioned, since everyday German says Staffel. "],["=",1065]]},{"field":"bodyDe","diff":[["=",192],["-","Heute"],["+","Im"],["=",1],["-","ist"],["+","Sport"],["=",1],["+","wurde "],["=",4],["-","eine"],["+","zur"],["=",29],["-","heißt"],["+","hieß"],["=",3],["-","Stafettenlauf."],["+","Stafettenlauf"],["=",1],["+","– ein Gebrauch, den Wörterbücher heute als veraltet führen, denn üblich ist inzwischen Staffel. "],["=",1007]]},{"field":"notesEn","old":"","new":"The card says Stafette means a relay team “today”; Duden and DWDS now label that sports sense old-fashioned – everyday German says Staffel."},{"field":"notesDe","old":"","new":"Die Karte sagt, Stafette bezeichne „heute“ eine Staffel; Duden und DWDS führen diese sportliche Bedeutung inzwischen als veraltet – üblich ist Staffel."},{"field":"notesRu","old":"","new":"На карточке сказано, что Stafette «сегодня» означает эстафетную команду; словари Duden и DWDS помечают это спортивное значение как устаревшее — обычно говорят Staffel."}],"hash":"3fcf026fb68d","actor":{"kind":"agent","name":"provenance-research"},"run":"provenance-research-2026-10-23","chain":"79d2466737f7310bc052dac4feb8d279d8623354e74dc1c047fb21c48a28c414"},
